---
import "./series-visual.css";
const steps = [
  {
    title: "接收任务",
    who: "交互层",
    text: "把用户的目标和约束交给运行程序。",
  },
  {
    title: "组织信息，调用模型",
    who: "上下文 · 模型接入",
    text: "发送任务、历史与工具说明，接收模型的回答或工具请求。",
  },
  {
    title: "执行动作，回传事实",
    who: "执行循环 · 工具",
    text: "检查请求并读取、修改文件或运行测试；把成功或失败结果加入历史，再回到第 2 步。",
  },
  {
    title: "结束这一轮",
    who: "执行循环 · 交互层",
    text: "模型不再请求工具时显示回答；用户中断或达到轮数上限也会结束运行。",
  },
];
---

<figure class="task-overview series-visual not-prose">
  <ol>
    {
      steps.map((step, index) => (
        <li>
          <span class="step" aria-hidden="true">
            {index + 1}
          </span>
          <div>
            <>
              <strong>{step.title}</strong>
              <span class="who">{step.who}</span>
              <p>{step.text}</p>
            </>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    机制示意。第 2、3
    步可能重复多次；一轮执行结束后，仍要依据文件和测试结果判断任务是否完成。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .task-overview {
    margin: 1.7rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .task-overview ol {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .task-overview li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0 0 1.2rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .task-overview li:not(:last-child)::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    bottom: 0.2rem;
    left: 0.95rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    height: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .who {
    display: block;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0.1rem 0;
  }
  .task-overview p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .task-overview figcaption {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    padding-top: 0.7rem;
  }
</style>
